\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Holy Father, in Thy mercy,
\par Hear our anxious prayer;
\par Keep our loved ones, now far distant,
\par 'Neath Thy care.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Jesus, Saviour, let Thy presence
\par Be their light and guide;
\par Keep, O keep them, in their weakness,
\par At Thy side.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. When in sorrow, when in danger,
\par When in loneliness,
\par In Thy love look down and comfort
\par Their distress.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. May the joy of Thy salvation
\par Be their strength and stay;
\par May they love and may they praise Thee
\par Day by day.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Holy Spirit, let Thy teaching
\par Sanctify their life;
\par Send Thy grace that they may conquer
\par In the strife.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Father, Son, and Holy Spirit,
\par God, the One in Three,
\par Bless them, guide them, save them, Keep them
\par Near to Thee.
\par                Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

